From 3be176d21d897c04223ef0ccf83d8b9d8a492218 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: designgears <bobby@designgears.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 17:15:07 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] wine-uwp: package identity from environment,
 TokenSecurityAttributes, GetCurrentPackageInfo2,
 CoGetSystemSecurityPermissions stub

- kernelbase: GetCurrentPackage{FullName,FamilyName,Path,Id}, GetCurrentApplicationUserModelId,
  GetPackageFullName/FamilyName, GetPackagePathByFullName, GetCurrentPackageInfo/Info2 read
  WINE_UWP_PACKAGE_* variables set by the wine-uwp launcher.
- kernelbase: AppPolicyGetWindowingModel reports Universal for packaged processes.
- ntdll: RtlQueryPackageIdentity/RtlQueryPackageClaims from the same variables.
- ntdll: NtQueryInformationToken(TokenSecurityAttributes) returns WIN://SYSAPPID and WIN://PKG.
- combase: CoGetSystemSecurityPermissions stub.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
